bin/
.code-review-graph/
# Machine-local Claude state — worktrees and caches — EXCEPT agent-memory,
# which is knowledge about this repo and has to travel with it.
.claude/*
!.claude/agent-memory/
.env
.DS_Store

# Throwaway measurement harnesses. A balance question is answered by fighting a
# few thousand battles from a scratch test, and the file that fought them is
# worth nothing afterwards — it names values that have since moved and asserts
# nothing. They must never be committed: a measurement frozen into the suite is a
# golden nobody wrote down, and it fails the day the data it measured changes.
zz_*_test.go

# Battle logs written from the authoring client. A log is an artefact of a
# battle somebody played rather than data the game is fought under, and it
# carries its own roster, so it is readable and verifiable without being tracked.
internal/seed/data/battles/
